 "sentences": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "start": 0.15,
   "speechStart": 0.15,
   "end": 2.825,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "By day, fishing vessels use shapes."
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start": 3.075,
   "speechStart": 3.075,
   "end": 8.975,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "A vessel engaged in fishing shows two cones with their points together, one above the other."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 9.225,
   "speechStart": 9.225,
   "end": 11.275,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "It looks like an hourglass."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 11.525,
   "speechStart": 11.525,
   "end": 19.25,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "And when her gear extends more than one hundred fifty meters, she adds a single cone, point up, in the direction of the gear."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 19.5,
   "speechStart": 19.5,
   "end": 23.925,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Same idea as the white light at night: it points to where the gear is."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 24.175,
   "speechStart": 24.925,
   "end": 29.0,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Now the other half of the rule, and it’s a favorite on the exam."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 29.25,
   "speechStart": 29.25,
   "end": 36.65,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "When a fishing vessel isn’t engaged in fishing, she shows only the ordinary lights or shapes for a vessel of her length."
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 36.9,
   "speechStart": 36.9,
   "end": 41.3,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "So think of a shrimper steaming home before dawn with her nets stowed."
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 41.55,
   "speechStart": 41.55,
   "end": 43.175,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "What does she show?"
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 43.425,
   "speechStart": 43.425,
   "end": 45.55,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Plain power-driven lights."
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 45.8,
   "speechStart": 45.8,
   "end": 48.625,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "And what privileges does she have over you?"
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 48.875,
   "speechStart": 48.875,
   "end": 50.2,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "None."
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start": 50.45,
   "speechStart": 50.45,
   "end": 53.325,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "She’s just another power-driven vessel."
  }
 ]
}
